Z||000009||dogtired||12-17-1999||04:08 PM||||OK I am for all this FREE services, so I thought I would throw this 2 cents in.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><BR>I use FREE JUNO for my E-Mail on all my list accounts. Now you might say "Whats so special about that?" Well I am glad you asked. JUNO will not accept any attachments, therefore if anyone is trying to send you a virus or disease it will not accept them.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><BR>If someone tries to send you something, you can send them your other address (whatever that may be) so they can send it there, if you think you want it.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><BR>Just thought you-all would like to know how I do it! Well E-Mail anyway?   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">||||reg||6
